      title: 'An external cost: beachfront resorts',
      question: 'A competitive resort developer has marginal private cost MC = 5q, and each unit also causes an external marginal cost of 5q. Demand is q = 66 − p. (a) Find the competitive and efficient outcomes and the deadweight loss. (b) How many licences would achieve the efficient outcome? (c) Find the Pigouvian tax and compare its revenue with the external cost at the efficient output.',
