      quiz: { q: 'π_T = 100 + 16T − T² − 4W and π_W = 16W − W².', parts: [['Windmills built independently', 8], ['Efficient number of windmills', 6], ['Rise in joint profit from internalising', 4]], solution: ['Alone: W = 8. Jointly: 16 − 2W − 4 = 0 gives W = 6.', 'Joint profit 200 against 132 + 64 = 196.'] },
